{"unit_id":"tag:0GJP:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>的一个对象（object）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的一个几何点（geometric point），其像（image）为<MATH_0006>。称<MATH_0007>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部无环于（locally acyclic at）<MATH_0008>且相对于（relative）<MATH_0009><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若对每个几何点（geometric point）<MATH_0010>（属于<MATH_0011>），映射（map）（<REF_0001>）是同构（isomorphism）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>我们不假设<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>的代数几何点（algebraic geometric point）。通常使用引理<REF_0002>可以归约到这一情形。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称<MATH_0014>为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>相对局部无环（locally acyclic relative）于<MATH_0015><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若<MATH_0016>局部无环于（locally acyclic at）<MATH_0017>且相对于（relative）<MATH_0018>，对每个几何点（geometric point）<MATH_0019>（属于<MATH_0020>）成立。\n<STRUCT_0004> 称<MATH_0021>为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>普遍相对局部无环（universally locally acyclic relative）于<MATH_0022><TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，若对任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0023>（在概形（schemes）之间），基变换（base change）<MATH_0024>相对局部无环（locally acyclic relative）于<MATH_0025>到<MATH_0026>的拉回（pullback）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 称<MATH_0027>为<TEXTITOPEN_0004>局部无环（locally acyclic）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>，若对所有几何点（geometric points）<MATH_0028>（属于<MATH_0029>）及任意整数（integer）<MATH_0030>，它与<MATH_0031>的特征（characteristic）互素（prime to），态射（morphism）<MATH_0032>局部无环于（locally acyclic at）<MATH_0033>且相对于（relative）取值为<MATH_0034>的常值（constant）层（sheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0006> 称<MATH_0035>为<TEXTITOPEN_0005>普遍局部无环（universally locally acyclic）<TEXTITCLOSE_0005>，若对任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0036>（在概形（schemes）之间），基变换（base change）<MATH_0037>局部无环（locally acyclic）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic at","target_term":"局部无环于"},{"source_term":"relative","target_term":"相对于"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"algebraic geometric point","target_term":"代数几何点"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic relative","target_term":"相对局部无环"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic at","target_term":"局部无环于"},{"source_term":"relative","target_term":"相对于"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"universally locally acyclic relative","target_term":"普遍相对局部无环"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic relative","target_term":"相对局部无环"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic","target_term":"局部无环"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数"},{"source_term":"characteristic","target_term":"特征"},{"source_term":"prime to","target_term":"互素"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic at","target_term":"局部无环于"},{"source_term":"relative","target_term":"相对于"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"universally locally acyclic","target_term":"普遍局部无环"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic","target_term":"局部无环"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"定义中的对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"定义对象及基变换"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"系数对象"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"定义的局部坐标"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"几何点的像"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic at","target_term":"局部无环于","context":"带点的局部无环性"},{"source_term":"relative","target_term":"相对于","context":"指定系数对象"},{"source_term