{"unit_id":"tag:0GJM:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是阿贝尔群（abelian group）。那么<MATH_0002>关于常值（constant）层（sheaf）<MATH_0003>的局部无环性（local acyclicity）归结为要求\n<MATHSEG_0001>若<MATHSEG_0002>若<MATHSEG_0003>\n，对任意几何点（geometric point）<MATH_0004>（属于<MATH_0005>）及任意几何点（geometric point）<MATH_0006>（属于<MATH_0007>）成立。这样可见，局部无环（locally acyclic）对应于几何纤维（geometric fibres）<MATH_0008>的高阶上同调群（cohomology groups）的消失，这些纤维属于在<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>处的严格（strict）亨泽尔化（henselizations）之间的映射（maps）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"local acyclicity","target_term":"局部无环性"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic","target_term":"局部无环"},{"source_term":"geometric fibres","target_term":"几何纤维"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格"},{"source_term":"henselizations","target_term":"亨泽尔化"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"abelian group","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"常值系数"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"local acyclicity","target_term":"局部无环性","context":"等价表述"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"局部坐标"},{"source_term":"locally acyclic","target_term":"局部无环","context":"消失条件"},{"source_term":"geometric fibres","target_term":"几何纤维","context":"严格局部化的纤维"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"高阶消失"},{"source_term":"strict","target_term":"严格","context":"亨泽尔化"},{"source_term":"henselizations","target_term":"亨泽尔化","context":"局部环的构造"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"严格亨泽尔化之间的关系"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0GJQ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）。那么<MATH_0002>普遍局部无环（universally locally acyclic）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"universally locally acyclic","target_term":"普遍局部无环"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射对象"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"态射假设"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"引理假设"},{"source_term":"universally locally acyclic","target_term":"普遍局部无环","context":"引理结论"}],"notes":[]}
